 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "s01_01",
   "text": "In 2007, Nokia was almost untouchable.",
   "scene": 1,
   "say": "In two thousand seven, Nokia was almost untouchable.",
   "t": 3.0,
   "local": 3.0,
   "dur": 3.511,
   "trim": 0.169
  },
  {
   "id": "s01_02",
   "text": "It sold approximately 437 million mobile devices in a single year.",
   "scene": 1,
   "say": "It sold approximately four hundred thirty-seven million mobile devices in a single year.",
   "t": 6.961,
   "local": 6.961,
   "dur": 5.494,
   "trim": 0.141
  },
  {
   "id": "s01_03",
   "text": "Its estimated share of the global mobile phone market was thirty-eight percent.",
   "scene": 1,
   "t": 12.906,
   "local": 12.906,
   "dur": 5.076,
   "trim": 0.19
  },
  {
   "id": "s01_04",
   "text": "Its phones were everywhere. In offices, schools, taxis, airports, and millions of homes.",
   "scene": 1,
   "t": 18.432,
   "local": 18.432,
   "dur": 6.662,
   "trim": 0.233
  },
  {
   "id": "s01_05",
   "text": "Nokia wasn't merely participating in the mobile revolution.",
   "scene": 1,
   "t": 25.544,
   "local": 25.544,
   "dur": 3.721,
   "trim": 0.097
  },
  {
   "id": "s01_06",
   "text": "It was leading it.",
   "scene": 1,
   "t": 29.715,
   "local": 29.715,
   "dur": 1.277,
   "trim": 0.135
  },
  {
   "id": "s01_07",
   "text": "And yet, just six years later, the company would announce the sale of its legendary handset business.",
   "scene": 1,
   "t": 31.441,
   "local": 31.441,
   "dur": 6.172,
   "trim": 0.181
  },
  {
   "id": "s01_08",
   "text": "How does a market leader lose the market it helped create?",
   "scene": 1,
   "t": 38.063,
   "local": 38.063,
   "dur": 3.5,
   "trim": 0.407
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_01",
   "text": "September third, 2013.",
   "scene": 2,
   "say": "September third, twenty thirteen.",
   "t": 43.263,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 2.158,
   "trim": 0.195
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_02",
   "text": "Nokia announced an agreement to sell substantially all of its Devices and Services business to Microsoft.",
   "scene": 2,
   "t": 45.871,
   "local": 3.208,
   "dur": 6.726,
   "trim": 0.147
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_03",
   "text": "The announced transaction was valued at approximately five point four four billion euros, including a patent licensing component.",
   "scene": 2,
   "t": 53.047,
   "local": 10.384,
   "dur": 8.131,
   "trim": 0.273
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_04",
   "text": "For millions of customers, Nokia had been synonymous with the mobile phone.",
   "scene": 2,
   "t": 61.627,
   "local": 18.964,
   "dur": 4.327,
   "trim": 0.144
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_05",
   "text": "Now, the company that once defined the category was preparing to leave handset manufacturing behind.",
   "scene": 2,
   "t": 66.404,
   "local": 23.741,
   "dur": 6.541,
   "trim": 0.026
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_06",
   "text": "But this wasn't the bankruptcy of Nokia.",
   "scene": 2,
   "t": 73.395,
   "local": 30.732,
   "dur": 2.097,
   "trim": 0.149
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_07",
   "text": "The company would continue operating.",
   "scene": 2,
   "t": 75.942,
   "local": 33.279,
   "dur": 2.105,
   "trim": 0.232
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_08",
   "text": "What had collapsed was its position as a dominant mobile phone manufacturer.",
   "scene": 2,
   "t": 78.497,
   "local": 35.834,
   "dur": 4.354,
   "trim": 0.188
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_01",
   "text": "Nokia's mobile dominance didn't happen by accident.",
   "scene": 3,
   "t": 84.551,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 3.276,
   "trim": 0.178
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_02",
   "text": "The Finnish company built an extraordinary combination of hardware engineering, manufacturing scale, distribution, and brand recognition.",
   "scene": 3,
   "t": 88.277,
   "local": 4.326,
   "dur": 8.624,
   "trim": 0.221
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_03",
   "text": "Its devices were dependable.",
   "scene": 3,
   "t": 97.351,
   "local": 13.4,
   "dur": 1.93,
   "trim": 0.191
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_04",
   "text": "Its designs were familiar.",
   "scene": 3,
   "t": 99.731,
   "local": 15.78,
   "dur": 1.768,
   "trim": 0.185
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_05",
   "text": "Its supply chain reached markets that competitors struggled to serve.",
   "scene": 3,
   "t": 101.949,
   "local": 17.998,
   "dur": 4.188,
   "trim": 0.091
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_06",
   "text": "By the late nineteen-nineties, Nokia had become the world's leading mobile phone manufacturer.",
   "scene": 3,
   "t": 106.587,
   "local": 22.636,
   "dur": 5.632,
   "trim": 0.17
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_07",
   "text": "And it continued expanding through the next decade.",
   "scene": 3,
   "t": 112.669,
   "local": 28.718,
   "dur": 3.105,
   "trim": 0.147
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_08",
   "text": "Its greatest advantage was the ability to make mobile technology accessible to enormous numbers of people.",
   "scene": 3,
   "t": 116.224,
   "local": 32.273,
   "dur": 7.172,
   "trim": 0.19
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_01",
   "text": "There's a popular explanation for Nokia's decline.",
   "scene": 4,
   "t": 125.096,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 3.127,
   "trim": 0.126
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_02",
   "text": "That it failed because it didn't understand smartphones.",
   "scene": 4,
   "t": 128.673,
   "local": 4.177,
   "dur": 3.289,
   "trim": 0.173
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_03",
   "text": "But that isn't accurate.",
   "scene": 4,
   "t": 132.412,
   "local": 7.916,
   "dur": 1.283,
   "trim": 0.11
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_04",
   "text": "Nokia was already selling sophisticated mobile computers before the first iPhone appeared.",
   "scene": 4,
   "t": 134.144,
   "local": 9.648,
   "dur": 5.884,
   "trim": 0.126
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_05",
   "text": "Its Nseries and Eseries devices combined cameras, internet access, email, navigation, and multimedia capabilities.",
   "scene": 4,
   "say": "Its N-series and E-series devices combined cameras, internet access, email, navigation, and multimedia capabilities.",
   "t": 140.478,
   "local": 15.982,
   "dur": 10.108,
   "trim": 0.222
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_06",
   "text": "The Nokia N95, introduced in 2007, was a powerful example.",
   "scene": 4,
   "say": "The Nokia N ninety-five, introduced in two thousand seven, was a powerful example.",
   "t": 151.036,
   "local": 26.54,
   "dur": 5.407,
   "trim": 0.439
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_07",
   "text": "Nokia understood that phones were becoming computers.",
   "scene": 4,
   "t": 156.893,
   "local": 32.397,
   "dur": 3.444,
   "trim": 0.185
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_08",
   "text": "What it underestimated was how radically the experience of using those computers was about to change.",
   "scene": 4,
   "t": 160.788,
   "local": 36.292,
   "dur": 6.779,
   "trim": 0.224
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_01",
   "text": "On January ninth, 2007, Apple introduced the iPhone.",
   "scene": 5,
   "say": "On January ninth, two thousand seven, Apple introduced the iPhone.",
   "t": 169.267,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 4.735,
   "trim": 0.142
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_02",
   "text": "It wasn't the first smartphone.",
   "scene": 5,
   "t": 174.452,
   "local": 5.785,
   "dur": 1.709,
   "trim": 0.143
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_03",
   "text": "And it wasn't the first touchscreen phone.",
   "scene": 5,
   "t": 176.612,
   "local": 7.945,
   "dur": 2.464,
   "trim": 0.137
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_04",
   "text": "But it brought a different philosophy into focus.",
   "scene": 5,
   "t": 179.525,
   "local": 10.858,
   "dur": 2.434,
   "trim": 0.099
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_05",
   "text": "A large touchscreen.",
   "scene": 5,
   "t": 182.409,
   "local": 13.742,
   "dur": 1.565,
   "trim": 0.17
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_06",
   "text": "Software designed around direct interaction.",
   "scene": 5,
   "t": 184.424,
   "local": 15.757,
   "dur": 3.607,
   "trim": 0.322
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_07",
   "text": "And a product experience in which hardware and operating system were tightly integrated.",
   "scene": 5,
   "t": 188.48,
   "local": 19.813,
   "dur": 5.464,
   "trim": 0.138
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_08",
   "text": "For Nokia, the immediate threat was not simply another expensive handset.",
   "scene": 5,
   "t": 194.394,
   "local": 25.727,
   "dur": 4.71,
   "trim": 0.137
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_09",
   "text": "It was a different definition of what a smartphone should feel like.",
   "scene": 5,
   "t": 199.554,
   "local": 30.887,
   "dur": 3.625,
   "trim": 0.278
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_01",
   "text": "The competition soon expanded beyond individual devices.",
   "scene": 6,
   "t": 204.879,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 3.599,
   "trim": 0.19
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_02",
   "text": "Apple launched its App Store in 2008.",
   "scene": 6,
   "say": "Apple launched its App Store in two thousand eight.",
   "t": 208.928,
   "local": 4.649,
   "dur": 2.812,
   "trim": 0.227
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_03",
   "text": "Google's Android ecosystem began growing across multiple manufacturers.",
   "scene": 6,
   "t": 212.19,
   "local": 7.911,
   "dur": 4.642,
   "trim": 0.19
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_04",
   "text": "Applications, developers, operating systems, and services became increasingly important.",
   "scene": 6,
   "t": 217.282,
   "local": 13.003,
   "dur": 6.078,
   "trim": 0.178
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_05",
   "text": "A smartphone was no longer judged only by its camera, battery, or physical design.",
   "scene": 6,
   "t": 223.81,
   "local": 19.531,
   "dur": 5.635,
   "trim": 0.163
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_06",
   "text": "Its software ecosystem determined what users could do with it.",
   "scene": 6,
   "t": 229.895,
   "local": 25.616,
   "dur": 4.137,
   "trim": 0.186
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_07",
   "text": "Nokia had services, applications, and an established operating system.",
   "scene": 6,
   "t": 234.482,
   "local": 30.203,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "trim": 0.186
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_08",
   "text": "But the market was moving toward integrated platforms at extraordinary speed.",
   "scene": 6,
   "t": 239.9,
   "local": 35.621,
   "dur": 4.763,
   "trim": 0.179
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_01",
   "text": "Nokia's principal smartphone operating system was Symbian.",
   "scene": 7,
   "t": 246.363,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 3.953,
   "trim": 0.091
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_02",
   "text": "It had helped power millions of capable devices.",
   "scene": 7,
   "t": 250.766,
   "local": 5.003,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "trim": 0.195
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_03",
   "text": "But its legacy architecture and development complexity made competing in the new touchscreen-centered market difficult.",
   "scene": 7,
   "t": 254.686,
   "local": 8.923,
   "dur": 8.273,
   "trim": 0.146
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_04",
   "text": "Nokia continued investing in Symbian while pursuing alternative software strategies.",
   "scene": 7,
   "t": 263.409,
   "local": 17.646,
   "dur": 5.218,
   "trim": 0.175
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_05",
   "text": "The challenge wasn't a complete absence of innovation.",
   "scene": 7,
   "t": 269.077,
   "local": 23.314,
   "dur": 3.163,
   "trim": 0.151
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_06",
   "text": "It was the difficulty of coordinating that innovation into one competitive platform.",
   "scene": 7,
   "t": 272.69,
   "local": 26.927,
   "dur": 5.188,
   "trim": 0.159
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_07",
   "text": "Every delay gave Apple and Android more time to attract customers, developers, and manufacturers.",
   "scene": 7,
   "t": 278.328,
   "local": 32.565,
   "dur": 7.138,
   "trim": 0.17
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_01",
   "text": "Nokia explored several routes into the future.",
   "scene": 8,
   "t": 287.167,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 3.029,
   "trim": 0.364
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_02",
   "text": "Symbian remained important.",
   "scene": 8,
   "t": 290.646,
   "local": 4.079,
   "dur": 2.164,
   "trim": 0.093
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_03",
   "text": "MeeGo represented another attempt to build a modern smartphone platform.",
   "scene": 8,
   "say": "Mee-Go represented another attempt to build a modern smartphone platform.",
   "t": 293.26,
   "local": 6.693,
   "dur": 4.701,
   "trim": 0.412
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_04",
   "text": "The company also invested in services, mapping, and new user experiences.",
   "scene": 8,
   "t": 298.411,
   "local": 11.844,
   "dur": 5.307,
   "trim": 0.182
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_05",
   "text": "These efforts showed that Nokia recognized the need for change.",
   "scene": 8,
   "t": 304.168,
   "local": 17.601,
   "dur": 5.008,
   "trim": 0.213
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_06",
   "text": "But recognizing change and delivering a unified response are different problems.",
   "scene": 8,
   "t": 309.626,
   "local": 23.059,
   "dur": 5.286,
   "trim": 0.209
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_07",
   "text": "Multiple technologies required resources, management attention, and difficult prioritization decisions.",
   "scene": 8,
   "t": 315.361,
   "local": 28.794,
   "dur": 6.737,
   "trim": 0.204
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_08",
   "text": "Meanwhile, the market was becoming less forgiving.",
   "scene": 8,
   "t": 322.548,
   "local": 35.981,
   "dur": 3.094,
   "trim": 0.187
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_09",
   "text": "The longer Nokia's transition took, the harder catching up became.",
   "scene": 8,
   "t": 326.092,
   "local": 39.525,
   "dur": 4.576,
   "trim": 0.155
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_01",
   "text": "In September 2010, Stephen Elop became Nokia's president and chief executive.",
   "scene": 9,
   "say": "In September twenty ten, Stephen Ee-lop became Nokia's president and chief executive.",
   "t": 332.368,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 5.865,
   "trim": 0.193
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_02",
   "text": "He inherited a company with enormous assets and a rapidly deteriorating competitive position in high-end smartphones.",
   "scene": 9,
   "t": 338.683,
   "local": 6.915,
   "dur": 7.39,
   "trim": 0.126
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_03",
   "text": "The question was no longer whether Nokia needed to change.",
   "scene": 9,
   "t": 346.523,
   "local": 14.755,
   "dur": 3.982,
   "trim": 0.184
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_04",
   "text": "It was how.",
   "scene": 9,
   "t": 350.955,
   "local": 19.187,
   "dur": 0.713,
   "trim": 0.136
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_05",
   "text": "Should Nokia continue developing its own smartphone platforms?",
   "scene": 9,
   "t": 352.118,
   "local": 20.35,
   "dur": 4.151,
   "trim": 0.126
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_06",
   "text": "Should it embrace Android?",
   "scene": 9,
   "t": 356.719,
   "local": 24.951,
   "dur": 1.79,
   "trim": 0.103
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_07",
   "text": "Or should it pursue a different partnership?",
   "scene": 9,
   "t": 358.958,
   "local": 27.19,
   "dur": 2.597,
   "trim": 0.197
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_08",
   "text": "Each option carried risks.",
   "scene": 9,
   "t": 362.005,
   "local": 30.237,
   "dur": 1.948,
   "trim": 0.187
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_09",
   "text": "But one decision would fundamentally redirect the company's future.",
   "scene": 9,
   "t": 364.403,
   "local": 32.635,
   "dur": 4.291,
   "trim": 0.165
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_01",
   "text": "On February eleventh, 2011, Nokia and Microsoft announced a strategic partnership.",
   "scene": 10,
   "say": "On February eleventh, twenty eleven, Nokia and Microsoft announced a strategic partnership.",
   "t": 370.395,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 6.321,
   "trim": 0.242
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_02",
   "text": "Windows Phone would become Nokia's primary smartphone platform.",
   "scene": 10,
   "t": 377.166,
   "local": 7.371,
   "dur": 4.364,
   "trim": 0.124
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_03",
   "text": "The logic was ambitious.",
   "scene": 10,
   "t": 381.981,
   "local": 12.186,
   "dur": 1.927,
   "trim": 0.175
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_04",
   "text": "Nokia would contribute hardware, distribution, and design expertise.",
   "scene": 10,
   "t": 384.357,
   "local": 14.562,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "trim": 0.136
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_05",
   "text": "Microsoft would contribute software, services, and a broader technology ecosystem.",
   "scene": 10,
   "t": 389.847,
   "local": 20.052,
   "dur": 5.758,
   "trim": 0.188
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_06",
   "text": "Together, they hoped to establish a powerful alternative to Apple and Android.",
   "scene": 10,
   "t": 396.055,
   "local": 26.26,
   "dur": 5.409,
   "trim": 0.127
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_07",
   "text": "But Nokia was committing its smartphone future to a platform that had not yet established comparable market scale.",
   "scene": 10,
   "t": 401.914,
   "local": 32.119,
   "dur": 7.22,
   "trim": 0.197
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_08",
   "text": "It was a strategic gamble.",
   "scene": 10,
   "t": 409.584,
   "local": 39.789,
   "dur": 2.097,
   "trim": 0.184
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_01",
   "text": "The partnership created an immediate problem.",
   "scene": 11,
   "t": 413.381,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 2.805,
   "trim": 0.199
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_02",
   "text": "Nokia needed customers to continue buying its existing smartphones while waiting for its new Windows Phone products.",
   "scene": 11,
   "t": 416.636,
   "local": 3.855,
   "dur": 7.057,
   "trim": 0.199
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_03",
   "text": "But the announcement made the company's future direction clear.",
   "scene": 11,
   "t": 424.143,
   "local": 11.362,
   "dur": 4.061,
   "trim": 0.121
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_04",
   "text": "Symbian was no longer the long-term centerpiece.",
   "scene": 11,
   "t": 428.654,
   "local": 15.873,
   "dur": 3.502,
   "trim": 0.061
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_05",
   "text": "In Nokia's own annual reporting, the company acknowledged that demand for Symbian devices deteriorated faster than anticipated during the transition.",
   "scene": 11,
   "t": 432.606,
   "local": 19.825,
   "dur": 9.515,
   "trim": 0.18
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_06",
   "text": "The new products needed time to establish themselves.",
   "scene": 11,
   "t": 442.571,
   "local": 29.79,
   "dur": 3.477,
   "trim": 0.208
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_07",
   "text": "The old products were losing momentum.",
   "scene": 11,
   "t": 446.497,
   "local": 33.716,
   "dur": 2.377,
   "trim": 0.243
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_08",
   "text": "Nokia was caught between two generations of its own strategy.",
   "scene": 11,
   "t": 449.325,
   "local": 36.544,
   "dur": 4.062,
   "trim": 0.163
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_01",
   "text": "In October 2011, Nokia introduced its first Lumia smartphones running Windows Phone.",
   "scene": 12,
   "say": "In October twenty eleven, Nokia introduced its first Lumia smartphones running Windows Phone.",
   "t": 455.087,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 6.563,
   "trim": 0.21
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_02",
   "text": "The Lumia family would showcase distinctive industrial design, imaging capabilities, and Microsoft's mobile software.",
   "scene": 12,
   "t": 462.1,
   "local": 7.613,
   "dur": 8.289,
   "trim": 0.191
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_03",
   "text": "These weren't simply poorly made phones.",
   "scene": 12,
   "t": 470.84,
   "local": 16.353,
   "dur": 2.791,
   "trim": 0.105
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_04",
   "text": "Nokia continued demonstrating serious hardware expertise.",
   "scene": 12,
   "t": 474.081,
   "local": 19.594,
   "dur": 3.787,
   "trim": 0.094
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_05",
   "text": "But strong hardware wasn't enough.",
   "scene": 12,
   "t": 478.319,
   "local": 23.832,
   "dur": 2.292,
   "trim": 0.119
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_06",
   "text": "Apple and Android already had powerful ecosystems of users, developers, applications, and commercial partners.",
   "scene": 12,
   "t": 481.061,
   "local": 26.574,
   "dur": 8.143,
   "trim": 0.164
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_07",
   "text": "Nokia now needed to persuade people to join a third platform.",
   "scene": 12,
   "t": 489.654,
   "local": 35.167,
   "dur": 4.125,
   "trim": 0.123
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_08",
   "text": "And platform competition rewards momentum.",
   "scene": 12,
   "t": 494.229,
   "local": 39.742,
   "dur": 3.318,
   "trim": 0.094
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_01",
   "text": "Nokia's own financial reporting revealed the damage.",
   "scene": 13,
   "t": 499.247,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 3.468,
   "trim": 0.135
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_02",
   "text": "Its smartphone business faced declining Symbian demand, pressure on selling prices, and difficulties during the platform transition.",
   "scene": 13,
   "t": 503.165,
   "local": 4.518,
   "dur": 8.279,
   "trim": 0.223
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_03",
   "text": "The company was still selling millions of phones.",
   "scene": 13,
   "t": 511.893,
   "local": 13.246,
   "dur": 2.652,
   "trim": 0.181
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_04",
   "text": "But scale alone no longer guaranteed leadership.",
   "scene": 13,
   "t": 514.995,
   "local": 16.348,
   "dur": 3.523,
   "trim": 0.177
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_05",
   "text": "Customers were moving toward competing smartphone ecosystems.",
   "scene": 13,
   "t": 518.968,
   "local": 20.321,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "trim": 0.22
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_06",
   "text": "Nokia's challenge was not merely producing an attractive replacement handset.",
   "scene": 13,
   "t": 523.008,
   "local": 24.361,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "trim": 0.137
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_07",
   "text": "It needed to rebuild its position in a market whose software and developer relationships were already shifting elsewhere.",
   "scene": 13,
   "t": 527.838,
   "local": 29.191,
   "dur": 7.221,
   "trim": 0.184
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_08",
   "text": "Time had become its scarcest resource.",
   "scene": 13,
   "t": 535.509,
   "local": 36.862,
   "dur": 2.719,
   "trim": 0.161
  },
  {
   "id": "s14_01",
   "text": "By September 2013, Nokia and Microsoft had agreed on the sale of substantially all of Nokia's Devices and Services business.",
   "scene": 14,
   "say": "By September twenty thirteen, Nokia and Microsoft had agreed on the sale of substantially all of Nokia's Devices and Services business.",
   "t": 539.928,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 8.63,
   "trim": 0.218
  },
  {
   "id": "s14_02",
   "text": "The announced transaction price was approximately five point four four billion euros, including patent-related arrangements.",
   "scene": 14,
   "t": 549.008,
   "local": 9.68,
   "dur": 8.339,
   "trim": 0.17
  },
  {
   "id": "s14_03",
   "text": "On April twenty-fifth, 2014, the sale was completed.",
   "scene": 14,
   "say": "On April twenty-fifth, twenty fourteen, the sale was completed.",
   "t": 557.797,
   "local": 18.469,
   "dur": 3.954,
   "trim": 0.085
  },
  {
   "id": "s14_04",
   "text": "Nokia retained important businesses and intellectual property.",
   "scene": 14,
   "t": 562.201,
   "local": 22.873,
   "dur": 4.107,
   "trim": 0.214
  },
  {
   "id": "s14_05",
   "text": "It would continue as a major telecommunications technology company.",
   "scene": 14,
   "t": 566.758,
   "local": 27.43,
   "dur": 3.969,
   "trim": 0.207
  },
  {
   "id": "s14_06",
   "text": "But the era of Nokia as the manufacturer behind one of the world's most recognizable handset empires had ended.",
   "scene": 14,
   "t": 571.177,
   "local": 31.849,
   "dur": 7.122,
   "trim": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_01",
   "text": "So what destroyed Nokia's handset dominance?",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 579.998,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 2.945,
   "trim": 0.128
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_02",
   "text": "Not one phone.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 583.393,
   "local": 3.995,
   "dur": 1.35,
   "trim": 0.085
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_03",
   "text": "Not one competitor.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 585.194,
   "local": 5.796,
   "dur": 1.812,
   "trim": 0.153
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_04",
   "text": "And not one executive decision.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 587.455,
   "local": 8.057,
   "dur": 2.496,
   "trim": 0.187
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_05",
   "text": "The evidence points to an accumulation of problems.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 590.402,
   "local": 11.004,
   "dur": 3.294,
   "trim": 0.145
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_06",
   "text": "Legacy software complexity.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 594.145,
   "local": 14.747,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "trim": 0.143
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_07",
   "text": "Slow execution during a fundamental market transition.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 596.683,
   "local": 17.285,
   "dur": 4.024,
   "trim": 0.111
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_08",
   "text": "Fragmented platform development.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 601.157,
   "local": 21.759,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "trim": 0.239
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_09",
   "text": "And a late strategic commitment to an ecosystem that struggled to match its rivals.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 603.839,
   "local": 24.44,
   "dur": 5.386,
   "trim": 0.181
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_10",
   "text": "Nokia's hardware strengths remained real.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 609.675,
   "local": 30.277,
   "dur": 2.525,
   "trim": 0.165
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_11",
   "text": "But the industry's competitive advantage had moved.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 612.649,
   "local": 33.251,
   "dur": 2.994,
   "trim": 0.185
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_12",
   "text": "The company could still build impressive phones.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 616.093,
   "local": 36.695,
   "dur": 2.886,
   "trim": 0.388
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_13",
   "text": "It could no longer reliably win the platform battle.",
   "scene": 15,
   "t": 619.429,
   "local": 40.031,
   "dur": 3.132,
   "trim": 0.139
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_01",
   "text": "Nokia's story contains a warning for every market leader.",
   "scene": 16,
   "t": 624.261,
   "local": 0.6,
   "dur": 3.555,
   "trim": 0.178
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_02",
   "text": "Dominance is evidence of past success.",
   "scene": 16,
   "t": 628.266,
   "local": 4.605,
   "dur": 2.84,
   "trim": 0.184
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_03",
   "text": "It is not proof of future relevance.",
   "scene": 16,
   "t": 631.557,
   "local": 7.896,
   "dur": 2.38,
   "trim": 0.083
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_04",
   "text": "The greatest danger isn't always failing to recognize change.",
   "scene": 16,
   "t": 634.386,
   "local": 10.725,
   "dur": 3.853,
   "trim": 0.226
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_05",
   "text": "Sometimes it's recognizing change, investing in it, and still moving too slowly to turn that investment into a winning strategy.",
   "scene": 16,
   "t": 638.689,
   "local": 15.028,
   "dur": 8.506,
   "trim": 0.221
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_06",
   "text": "Nokia didn't disappear.",
   "scene": 16,
   "t": 647.645,
   "local": 23.984,
   "dur": 1.832,
   "trim": 0.138
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_07",
   "text": "It reinvented itself beyond handsets.",
   "scene": 16,
   "t": 649.927,
   "local": 26.266,
   "dur": 2.657,
   "trim": 0.145
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_08",
